  "goodToKnow": "Die Demografie (also Demographie) is demography or demographics. Der demografische Wandel, Germany's ageing and shrinking working population, is a central political topic: as the Babyboomer generation retires, fewer contributors pay into the Rentenversicherung, and Fachkräftemangel (shortage of skilled workers) grows. Germany's population nonetheless rose to about 84 million through immigration. It has no plural."
